  "body": "**Motivation**\r\n\r\nFulu replaced blob sidecars with data columns, and the `blob_sidecars_by_range` and `blob_sidecars_by_root` req/resp protocols are deprecated as of `FULU_FORK_EPOCH + MIN_EPOCHS_FOR_BLOB_SIDECARS_REQUESTS`, which has passed on all supported networks. Lodestar only supports following the head from Fulu (see `docs/pages/run/beacon-management/historical-fork-support.md`), so the live blob sidecar path is dead code.\r\n\r\n**Description**\r\n\r\nRemoved:\r\n\r\n- `blob_sidecar` gossip topic, validation and publishing\r\n- `blob_sidecars_by_range` and `blob_sidecars_by_root` req/resp, both serving and requesting\r\n- blob download in range sync and unknown block sync\r\n- `engine_getBlobsV1` and fetching blobs from the EL for pre-Fulu blocks\r\n- `BlockInputBlobs`, deneb..electra blocks now use `BlockInputPreData`\r\n- writing blob sidecars to the DB, plus the related metrics and dashboard panels\r\n\r\nBehavior for deneb..electra blocks:\r\n\r\n- they are imported without a data availability check (`DataAvailabilityStatus.NotRequired`)\r\n- versioned hashes for `engine_newPayload` are derived from the block body's kzg commitments\r\n- `publishBlockV2` still accepts block contents, but the blobs are discarded\r\n\r\nKept for now and phased out per #9956: the blob DB repositories and read paths, `GET /eth/v1/beacon/blob_sidecars/{block_id}`, `GET /eth/v1/beacon/blobs/{block_id}` and the `blob_sidecar` event definition.\r\n",
